{# Shared destination picker markup, used by both the "Realizar" and
   "Solo redactar" pages. Requires the styles partial
   (_partials/organism_picker_styles.html.twig) in the page's stylesheets.

   The old nivel→ámbito→organismo→unidad cascade has been replaced by a unified
   destination-search modal (see realizar_picker_controller.js): one search that
   matches by name AND DIR3 code across REG units and Portal/AGE bodies, with
   facets and progressive loading.

   Params:
     draft_only  — bool; when true the picker creates draft-only requests
                   (POSTs `draftOnly: true` to the shared initiate endpoint) #}
<div class="picker-grid"
     data-controller="realizar-picker"
     data-realizar-picker-destinations-url-value="{{ path('app_solicitudes_realizar_destinations_json') }}"
     data-realizar-picker-destination-facets-url-value="{{ path('app_solicitudes_realizar_destinations_facets_json') }}"
     data-realizar-picker-initiate-url-value="{{ path('app_solicitudes_realizar_initiate') }}"
     data-realizar-picker-draft-only-value="{{ (draft_only|default(false)) ? 'true' : 'false' }}">

    <section class="picker-card">
        <div class="picker-step">
            <span class="picker-card-label">Destinatarios</span>
            <p class="picker-help" style="margin-top:.25rem;">
                Busca el organismo o la unidad concreta por nombre o por código DIR3. Puedes añadir varios: crearemos una solicitud independiente para cada uno.
            </p>
            <button type="button"
                    class="picker-add-btn"
                    data-realizar-picker-target="addButton"
                    data-action="realizar-picker#openDestinationModal">
                <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Añadir destinatario
            </button>
        </div>

        <p class="picker-help">
            <b>¿No encuentras el tuyo?</b> Buscamos en el Portal de Transparencia (AGE) y en las unidades del REG / RED SARA del catálogo DIR3. Si tu organismo no está, podrás registrarlo desde "Ya la envié".
        </p>

        <div class="picker-cta-row">
            <a href="{{ path('app_solicitudes_new') }}" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2"></i> Atrás
            </a>
            <button type="button"
                    class="btn btn-primary"
                    data-realizar-picker-target="continueButton"
                    data-action="realizar-picker#submit"
                    disabled>
                Continuar a la redacción
                <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4 ml-2"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <aside data-realizar-picker-target="preview"></aside>
</div>
